    "name": "Bomber Escort",
    "stratConScenarioType": "NONE",
    "shortBriefing": "Escort allied bombers through interceptors to their target.",
    "detailedBriefing": "Allied bombers are inbound to hit a priority target, and enemy interceptors are scrambling to knock them down before they can release. The bombers are loaded, sluggish, and cannot defend themselves—that is your job.\n\nFly close escort. The interceptors will try to slip past you to reach the bombers, so you cannot just chase kills; you have to stay between them and your charges. Keep the bombers flying long enough to complete the run. Aces mean nothing if the bombers never reach the target.\n\nKeep the bomber flight intact and drive off the interceptors.",
